cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this formalization, please cite it as below.
title: 'Critical long-range conductance: a Lean 4 formalization'
abstract: A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of both arXiv versions of a paper on the critical long-range
  random conductance model. For the second version, every labeled result is proved with no cited
  hypothesis, including quantitative homogenization of the heat equation and the annealed invariance
  principle. For the first version, quantitative homogenization of the resolvent equation and the
  quenched invariance principle are formalized with 16 cited propositions as explicit hypotheses.
type: software
